V-Mode within Sprints)", "activities": "Execute formal verification on fixed requirements immediately after code commit. Perform Unit Testing (boundary values for R1/R2),", "roles": "QA Engineer, Security Engineer", "deliverables": "Verification Vignette (Evidence of correct behavior), Unit Test Reports, Static Analysis Reports", "gate": "Automated Gate: Tests must pass; Formal Proof required for R6/R7 logic.", "reqs": "R1, R2, R3, R4, R5, R6, R7, R8, R9, R10"}, {"phase": "5. Security Integration (DevSecOps)", "activities": "Implement SAST/DAST for R9 (OTP expiry), R4 (Watermark integrity). Integrate penetration testing for remote KYC.", "roles": "Security Engineer, Lead Developer", "deliverables": "Security Assessment Report, SAST/DAST Results, Penetration Test Report", "gate": "Security Gate: R9 must pass OTP validation checks; R4 watermark must be cryptographically verified.", "reqs": "R3, R4, R8, R9"}, {"phase": "6. Compliance & Audit Log Implementation", "activities": "Build the audit trail for R10 ensuring immutability (12-month retention). Map all decisions to authorized officers (R3, R8).", "roles": "Backend Developer, Compliance Officer", "deliverables": "Audit Log Schema, Retention Policy Document, Access Control Matrix", "gate": "Compliance Gate: Verify 12-month retention policy and officer authorization logs against RBI guidelines.", "reqs": "R3, R4, R8, R10"}]}
